    <string name="dolby_bass_summary">Past chastotalarni ajrating. Basni aniqroq sozlash uchun grafik ekvalayzerdan foydalaning.</string>
    <string name="dolby_volume_summary">Treklar hamda sokin yoki baland qismlar orasidagi ovoz balandligi farqini kamaytiring.</string>
    <string name="dolby_speaker_summary">Ichki karnaylarga kengroq surround taassurotini qo‘shing.</string>
