    <string name="dolby_geq_graph_hint">Diapazonga teging va sozlash uchun yuqoriga yoki pastga torting; qo‘llash uchun qo‘yib yuboring.</string>
    <string name="dolby_geq_graph_description">20 diapazonli ekvalayzer grafigi. Chastota chapdan o‘ngga oshadi; kuchaytirish minus 10 dan plyus 10 dB gacha. Aniq sozlash uchun quyidagi diapazon boshqaruvlaridan foydalaning.</string>
